      "created_at": "2012-12-01T22:21:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Good day everyone!</p><p>I'm a new member to these forums, but not entierly new to SotM. I found the game a few months ago when &gt;G was running the Infernal Relics kickstarter, so after I looked into the game some more I quickly bought one of the damaged core sets (it was all I could afford at the time). I was a bit unsure of how fun a co-op game could be, but I immediatly fell in love with the game and soon obtained the Rook City expansion. I also partook in the Shattered Timelines expansion kickstarter, and now not only will I be recieving the expansion, but I will also be a playtester, so I look forward to testing with the rest of you (who are also playtesters).</p>",
